# Certificate lineages managed on this server.
#
# One line per certificate: <lineage-name> <extra domain> <extra domain> ...
# The FIRST domain names the lineage, so it must match the path used in
# nginx/conf.d/*.conf: /etc/letsencrypt/live/<first-domain>/
#
# Every hostname that nginx terminates TLS for MUST be listed here, otherwise
# it ends up missing from the cert's SAN list and browsers reject it with
# "no alternative certificate subject name matches".
#
# Read by scripts/ensure-certs.sh (runs on every deploy) and usable directly:
#   bash scripts/fix-cert.sh $(grep -v '^#' certs.list | head -1)

slotik.tech www.slotik.tech admin.slotik.tech
severbus.ru www.severbus.ru
